Keep the unwrap: importing
// `{ Chatbot }` by name fails under Node ESM, which can't see the kit's named
// exports.

// A window remembered from a larger screen must not outgrow the
          // viewport, even when no resize event arrives. Percentages resolve
          // against the containing block: the viewport, unless an ancestor
          // sets transform, filter or similar. A min size wins over a max size
          // in CSS, so the minimums are capped at 100% too; the 50vw/50dvh
          // floor keeps the window visible inside a small such ancestor.
